{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And I fell down before HaShem as at the first.</b> Just as I did during the first forty days, when I fell down before the Holy One, blessed be He, over His saying ״הרף ממני ואשמידם,״ until He stipulated with them that He would not destroy them — as it is said, ״וינחם ה' על הרעה״ — but He did not forgive the sin. And now I fell down for forgiveness of the sin, for I was afraid of the anger and the wrath; ״וישמע ה' אלי גם בפעם הזאת״ — to forgive the sin, concerning which He had sworn the first time not to destroy."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:42.153297164Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}